blocks.en:
A preliminary version of this work will be presented at SPIE Asia-Pacific
Remote Sensing 2026 ( Natsume and Yeo, 2026 ) . This journal
submission substantially extends that conference paper with:
(i) a systematic pretraining data scaling study across eight pretraining data
fractions with formal statistical testing (Section 4.5 );
(ii) a Centered Kernel Alignment representation analysis characterizing
how encoder representations evolve with pretraining data
quantity (Section 4.7 );
(iii) a full geographic de-collision analysis re-pretraining SparK-SAR
from scratch on a de-collided corpus with all overlapping pretraining
tiles removed, confirming that reported gains are not attributable to
geographic data leakage (Section 4.8 );
(iv) a finetuning label efficiency analysis demonstrating that SparK-SAR pretraining
provides statistically significant accuracy gains over random initialization
at every label fraction and every task (Section 4.6 );
(v) a dedicated Flood-S1 ceiling ablation across loss functions and fusion
strategies (Section 4.4.4 );
(vi) an expanded negative-results discussion;
and (vii) extended methodological detail throughout.

blocks.zh:
这项工作的初步版本将在亚太空间信息网络上介绍。
遥感2026年(夏美和,2026年). 这个日记
提交文件大大延长了会议文件:
(一) 在8个培训前数据中系统地开展培训前数据规模研究
有正式统计测试的分数(第4.5节);
(二) 核心内核对齐表述分析
编码器表达式如何随预训数据演变
数量(第4.7节);
(三) 全面进行地理脱钩分析,重新培训SparK-SAR
从头到尾在脱钩 与所有重叠的预训
已删除的瓦片,确认报告的收益不归因于
地理数据泄漏(第4.8节);
(四) 微调标签效率分析,证明SparK-SAR预训
提供比随机初始化在统计上显著的准确性增益
每一标签分号和每项任务(第4.6节);
(五) 专用的 " S1洪水 " 上限,涵盖损失功能和聚变
战略(第4.4.4节);
(六) 扩大负面结果讨论;
(七) 将方法细节扩大到整个过程。
